{"batchcomplete":"","query":{"pages":{"6455438":{"pageid":6455438,"ns":6,"title":"File:F-16XL Scamp Flow Visualization Test - GPN-2000-001935.jpg","index":3,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":5203348,"width":2400,"height":3000,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/F-16XL_Scamp_Flow_Visualization_Test_-_GPN-2000-001935.jpg/500px-F-16XL_Scamp_Flow_Visualization_Test_-_GPN-2000-001935.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":500,"thumbheight":625,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/F-16XL_Scamp_Flow_Visualization_Test_-_GPN-2000-001935.jpg/1280px-F-16XL_Scamp_Flow_Visualization_Test_-_GPN-2000-001935.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/F-16XL_Scamp_Flow_Visualization_Test_-_GPN-2000-001935.jpg/500px-F-16XL_Scamp_Flow_Visualization_Test_-_GPN-2000-001935.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":500,"height":625,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/F-16XL_Scamp_Flow_Visualization_Test_-_GPN-2000-001935.jpg/1280px-F-16XL_Scamp_Flow_Visualization_Test_-_GPN-2000-001935.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cc/F-16XL_Scamp_Flow_Visualization_Test_-_GPN-2000-001935.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:F-16XL_Scamp_Flow_Visualization_Test_-_GPN-2000-001935.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=6455438","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"An <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_Dynamics_F-16XL\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:General Dynamics F-16XL\">F-16 SCAMP</a> model at 4% scale being tested in the NASA Basic Aerodynamics Research Tunnel (Facility 1214) at the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Langley_Research_Center\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Langley Research Center\">Langley Research Center</a>. Photo shows a basic flow visualization test using smoke flowing with the air, and three laser light sheets to illuminate it above the model. This experiment highlights <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wingtip_vortices\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Wingtip vortices\">vortices trailing from the leading-edge</a> and was part of the NASA High Speed Research Program.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://dayton.hq.nasa.gov/IMAGES/LARGE/GPN-2000-001935.jpg\" href=\"https://dayton.hq.nasa.gov/IMAGES/LARGE/GPN-2000-001935.jpg\">Great Images in NASA</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://grin.hq.nasa.gov/ABSTRACTS/GPN-2000-001935.html\" href=\"https://grin.hq.nasa.gov/ABSTRACTS/GPN-2000-001935.html\">Description</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"NASA","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"40835549":{"pageid":40835549,"ns":6,"title":"File:Flow Visualization 4 % Scale F-16XL Scamp DVIDS704669.jpg","index":4,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":5236835,"width":2400,"height":3000,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/Flow_Visualization_4_%25_Scale_F-16XL_Scamp_DVIDS704669.jpg/500px-Flow_Visualization_4_%25_Scale_F-16XL_Scamp_DVIDS704669.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":500,"thumbheight":625,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/Flow_Visualization_4_%25_Scale_F-16XL_Scamp_DVIDS704669.jpg/1280px-Flow_Visualization_4_%25_Scale_F-16XL_Scamp_DVIDS704669.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/Flow_Visualization_4_%25_Scale_F-16XL_Scamp_DVIDS704669.jpg/500px-Flow_Visualization_4_%25_Scale_F-16XL_Scamp_DVIDS704669.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":500,"height":625,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/Flow_Visualization_4_%25_Scale_F-16XL_Scamp_DVIDS704669.jpg/1280px-Flow_Visualization_4_%25_Scale_F-16XL_Scamp_DVIDS704669.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5e/Flow_Visualization_4_%25_Scale_F-16XL_Scamp_DVIDS704669.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flow_Visualization_4_%25_Scale_F-16XL_Scamp_DVIDS704669.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=40835549","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"An F-16XL Scamp model, four per cent the size of the full-scale aircraft, is tested in the Basic Aerodynamics Research Tunnel (BART) at NASA Langley Research Center in Hampton, Virginia as part of NASAs High Speed Research Program. The photograph shows a basic flow visualization test using smoke and a laser light sheet to illuminate the smoke. The tests will be used to investigate the basic flow field on the F-16XL before actual flight tests are made. The F-16XL is at Langley for the High-Lift Project, one element of the NASA High-Speed Research Program. The joint Langley-Dryden high-lift flight test program is aimed at improving performance, reducing engine noise and limiting noise exposure by using specially-designed high-lift devices on or in the wing. Even though this is a fighter-type aircraft, the sweep and general arrangement of the uniquely-designed cranked arrow wing resemble those planned for the next generation of high-speed civil transport. Flight tests of the F-16XL will allow Langley engineers to determine the accuracy of their ground- generated information and predictive methods including wind tunnel tests, computer simulations and piloted simulations.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"This image or video was catalogued by Langley Research Center of the United States <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/NASA\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:NASA\">National Aeronautics and Space Administration</a> (NASA)\u00a0under <b>Photo\u00a0ID:</b> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://images.nasa.gov/search?q=EL-1996-00201&amp;page=1&amp;media=image,video,audio&amp;yearStart=1920&amp;yearEnd=2026\">EL-1996-00201</a>\u00a0and <b>Alternate\u00a0ID:</b> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://images.nasa.gov/search?q=L92-11006&amp;page=1&amp;media=image,video,audio&amp;yearStart=1920&amp;yearEnd=2026\">L92-11006</a>.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"Glenn Research Center","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"6450038":{"pageid":6450038,"ns":6,"title":"File:Model in Vortex Facility - GPN-2000-001288.jpg","index":2,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":4915609,"width":3000,"height":2400,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Model_in_Vortex_Facility_-_GPN-2000-001288.jpg/500px-Model_in_Vortex_Facility_-_GPN-2000-001288.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":500,"thumbheight":400,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Model_in_Vortex_Facility_-_GPN-2000-001288.jpg/1280px-Model_in_Vortex_Facility_-_GPN-2000-001288.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Model_in_Vortex_Facility_-_GPN-2000-001288.jpg/500px-Model_in_Vortex_Facility_-_GPN-2000-001288.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":500,"height":400,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Model_in_Vortex_Facility_-_GPN-2000-001288.jpg/1280px-Model_in_Vortex_Facility_-_GPN-2000-001288.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/da/Model_in_Vortex_Facility_-_GPN-2000-001288.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Model_in_Vortex_Facility_-_GPN-2000-001288.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=6450038","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"A <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boeing_747\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Boeing 747\">B-747</a> model has just passed through a stationary sheet of smoke, which is showing its <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wingtip_vortices\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Wingtip vortices\">trailing vortices</a>, at the Vortex Facility at the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Langley_Research_Center\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Langley Research Center\">Langley Research Center</a>.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://dayton.hq.nasa.gov/IMAGES/LARGE/GPN-2000-001288.jpg\" href=\"https://dayton.hq.nasa.gov/IMAGES/LARGE/GPN-2000-001288.jpg\">Great Images in NASA</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://grin.hq.nasa.gov/ABSTRACTS/GPN-2000-001288.html\" href=\"https://grin.hq.nasa.gov/ABSTRACTS/GPN-2000-001288.html\">Description</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"NASA/LARC/photographer unknown","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"150560817":{"pageid":150560817,"ns":6,"title":"File:Project Mercury Escape Tower Rockets Tests (GRC-1960-C-53287).jpg","index":1,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":700379,"width":2048,"height":1536,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Project_Mercury_Escape_Tower_Rockets_Tests_%28GRC-1960-C-53287%29.jpg/500px-Project_Mercury_Escape_Tower_Rockets_Tests_%28GRC-1960-C-53287%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":500,"thumbheight":375,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Project_Mercury_Escape_Tower_Rockets_Tests_%28GRC-1960-C-53287%29.jpg/1280px-Project_Mercury_Escape_Tower_Rockets_Tests_%28GRC-1960-C-53287%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Project_Mercury_Escape_Tower_Rockets_Tests_%28GRC-1960-C-53287%29.jpg/500px-Project_Mercury_Escape_Tower_Rockets_Tests_%28GRC-1960-C-53287%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":500,"height":375,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Project_Mercury_Escape_Tower_Rockets_Tests_%28GRC-1960-C-53287%29.jpg/1280px-Project_Mercury_Escape_Tower_Rockets_Tests_%28GRC-1960-C-53287%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8a/Project_Mercury_Escape_Tower_Rockets_Tests_%28GRC-1960-C-53287%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Project_Mercury_Escape_Tower_Rockets_Tests_(GRC-1960-C-53287).jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=150560817","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"A Mercury capsule is mounted inside the Altitude Wind Tunnel for a test of its escape tower rockets at the National Aeronautics and Space Administration (NASA) Lewis Research Center. In October 1959 NASA\u2019s Space Task Group allocated several Project Mercury assignments to Lewis. The Altitude Wind Tunnel was quickly modified so that its 51-foot diameter western leg could be used as a test chamber. The final round of tests in the Altitude Wind Tunnel sought to determine if the smoke plume from the capsule\u2019s escape tower rockets would shroud or compromise the spacecraft. The escape tower, a 10-foot steel rig with three small rockets, was attached to the nose of the Mercury capsule. It could be used to jettison the astronaut and capsule to safety in the event of a launch vehicle malfunction on the pad or at any point prior to separation from the booster. Once actuated, the escape rockets would fire, and the capsule would be ejected away from the booster. After the capsule reached its apex of about 2,500 feet, the tower, heatshield, retropackage, and antenna would be ejected and a drogue parachute would be released. Flight tests of the escape system were performed at Wallops Island as part of the series of Little Joe launches. Although the escape rockets fired prematurely on Little Joe\u2019s first attempt in August 1959, the January 1960 follow-up was successful.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"This image or video was catalogued by Glenn Research Center of the United States <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/NASA\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:NASA\">National Aeronautics and Space Administration</a> (NASA)\u00a0under <b>Photo\u00a0ID:</b> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://images.nasa.gov/search?q=GRC-1960-C-53287&amp;page=1&amp;media=image,video,audio&amp;yearStart=1920&amp;yearEnd=2026\">GRC-1960-C-53287</a>.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nasa.gov/glenn/\">NASA Glenn Research Center</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]}}}}